    {
      "type": "text",
      "json": [
        {
          "text": "When thrust into the dark, it is a person's natural instinct to look for light. Wizards are typically able to do so magically with ease, and are often the first ones to banish the darkness.\n\nThis will spawn a "
        },
        {
          "text": "permanent stationary orb of light or make a target glow for a while",
          "color": "dark_purple"
        },
        {
          "text": ".  Should be useful against targets that like to go invisible.  I bet if they're glowing, invisible or not, they lose a lot of their advantage and strength."
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
